      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جفّنوا</span></b>  <i>They made bowls</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِفَان</span> [probably
meaning <i>they prepared bowls of food:</i> accord. to
Freytag's Lex., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جفّن</span> means “ apposuit scutellam;
but he does not name his authority]). (TA.) ＝   
